<nav rm='7086'/><streamWindow id='main' title='Story' subtitle=" - Wehnimer's, Erebor Square" location='center' target='drop'/><streamWindow id='room' title='Room' subtitle=" - Wehnimer's, Erebor Square" location='center' target='drop' ifClosed='' resident='true'/><clearStream id='room'/><pushStream id='room'/><compDef id='room desc'>This quiet corner resembles a calm island amid the bustling life of Wehnimer's Landing.  At the west end, a low, broad dome is visible.  In the center of the square, several benches of polished wood and smooth stone surround a <a exist="-27592" noun="sculpture">sculpture</a> that stands as a sentinel before the <a exist="-2480" noun="Museum">Wehnimer's Museum</a>.  Cast in bronze, the work imparts a sense of peace, calm and protection to the landscaped surroundings.  A <a exist="-27591" noun="plaque">gold plaque</a> mounted on a gracefully chiseled malachite base stands before it.</compDef><compDef id='room objs'>  You also see an <a exist="-10378" noun="gate">ironwork gate</a>.</compDef>
